<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Biopsys started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Biopsys started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has started coverage of Biopsys Medical Inc with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said Friday.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Steve Pignalosa and Melissa Wilmoth were not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Biopsys, an Irvine, Calif.-based maker of products for diagnosing breast cancer, closed Thursday at 20-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
